Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.00,0:00:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fn华文楷体\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&\b0}影片压制：小鱼 字幕调校：小鱼 招募Q号：76846146{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.32,0:00:19.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}片名：人皮客栈II
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.17,0:03:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他说早上好 问你手怎么样了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He say, "Good morning, " and ask, "How is your hand? "{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.41,0:03:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好点了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's… It's better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.11,0:03:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它会怎样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's left of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.35,0:03:40.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抱歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.05,0:03:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等你痊愈之后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We would like to speak with you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.43,0:03:43.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们会和你谈谈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you feel well enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.02,0:03:46.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 那好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.66,0:03:50.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 咖啡？- 不 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Coffee? - No, thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.66,0:03:57.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}跟我们说说你提到的那个在斯洛伐克的地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell us about this place you mention, in Slovakia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.33,0:04:00.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是个…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's this…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.07,0:04:02.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}像某种工厂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's some kind of factory…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.50,0:04:05.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那里的人都很有钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}where these people, these very rich people…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.17,0:04:09.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们花钱折磨和残害孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}they pay to torture and kill kids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.78,0:04:11.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}其中大多数是背包路过旅游的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mostly backpackers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.22,0:04:16.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们杀死了我的两个朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they killed two of my friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.57,0:04:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们把你从客栈带走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They take you from this hostel…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.24,0:04:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}带你来那座工厂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they bring you to this factory and…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.47,0:04:42.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我去那里找乔许{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I went there looking for Josh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.44,0:04:46.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是我的一个朋友 他们把他带去了那里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was one of my friends and they took him there and{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.62,0:04:51.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}后来他们…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.65,0:04:52.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们杀了他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They killed him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.29,0:04:57.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}太可怕了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was horrible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.77,0:05:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他问你是怎么活下来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He ask how you survive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.01,0:05:16.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.02,0:05:27.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是逃出来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I escaped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.83,0:05:40.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们的头是谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who organize this place?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.14,0:05:46.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道 像是某种狩猎俱乐部 他们…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. It's some kind of hunting club. They…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.04,0:05:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们有同样的纹身{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They all have the same tattoo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.31,0:05:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是一只狗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a dog.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.61,0:05:53.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一种猎犬{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a bloodhound dog.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.90,0:06:10.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说的这个纹身很奇怪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strange that you mention this tattoo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.77,0:06:12.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.48,0:06:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为一个死在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because someone was found dead…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.93,0:06:26.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}维也纳火车站洗手间里的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in a train station bathroom in Vienna…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.58,0:06:28.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也有和你描述相同的纹身{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}with this same bloodhound tattoo you describe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.36,0:06:38.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那天车站的监控录像显示{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Security tapes from this station show…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.42,0:06:40.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是从一个月台进去的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}him entering from a platform…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.70,0:06:44.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那个月台正好停着一辆 从斯洛伐克早到的火车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}where a train arrive earlier that day from Slovakia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.03,0:06:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它正好途径维也纳那一站{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It came through the same station in Vienna.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.04,0:06:54.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}录像里的那个人就是你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were on that tape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.85,0:07:03.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是这样的纹身吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did his tattoo look something like this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.15,0:07:05.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是他妈的怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.99,0:07:08.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}救命啊 快来人啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help! Somebody help me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.94,0:07:22.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天呐！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.61,0:07:35.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你饿了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hungry?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.65,0:07:37.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在是凌晨三点十五分{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's 3:15 in the morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.89,0:07:39.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这些我不得不和食物一起吃下去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to take these with food.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.23,0:07:40.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想知道你是不是也想吃点东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna know if you want anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.82,0:07:43.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 我想让你跟别人谈谈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I want you to talk to someone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.73,0:07:46.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你打算什么时候告诉乔许的妈妈 发生了什么事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When are you gonna tell Josh's mother what happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.03,0:07:48.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不会告诉她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.66,0:07:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她一直认为她的儿子还在欧洲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She still thinks her sors in Europe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.70,0:07:54.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那我到底要怎么跟她解释？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck am I supposed to tell her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.17,0:07:56.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她可以直接去报警{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'll go straight to the police.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.68,0:07:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是啊 没错 是该有人去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, exactly. Someone should.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.41,0:08:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 谁也别去 你不明白的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no one should. You don't get it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.47,0:08:02.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这些人对每个人都感兴趣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These people are tied into everyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.74,0:08:04.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一开始他们只是问问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody starts asking questions…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.38,0:08:06.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后就会跟着你 直到找到你的住处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're gonna come after me and find me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.65,0:08:08.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来我祖母的房子？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}At my grandmother's house?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.37,0:08:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}虽然我还是个孩子的时候就在这里了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been coming here since I was a kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.68,0:08:12.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但还是很容易迷路{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can barely find the place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.08,0:08:13.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我每次必须问我姐姐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to ask my sister for directions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.69,0:08:15.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你告诉你姐姐我们在这里？- 是的 怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You told your sister we were here? - Yeah. So?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.92,0:08:18.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 还有谁知道？- 没了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, who else knows? - No one!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.63,0:08:20.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.23,0:08:22.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我这么做也是为了保护你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm doing this for your protection too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.47,0:08:23.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道的 不是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.93,0:08:26.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 派斯顿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Paxton…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.60,0:08:29.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.20,0:08:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我带你回来 是因为我也不好受{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took you back because I felt bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.14,0:08:35.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是你快疯了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're going crazy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.74,0:08:37.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你每夜都尖叫着惊醒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wake up every night screaming, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.47,0:08:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这样我没法睡觉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I can't sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.41,0:08:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 以后不会再有了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that won't be a problem anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.22,0:08:42.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}派斯顿 我不是故意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paxton, that's not what I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.82,0:08:46.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 该死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, fuck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.52,0:09:18.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}早上好！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morning!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.20,0:09:39.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}派斯顿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paxton?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.22,0:09:49.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.73,0:11:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗娜？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lorna?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.50,0:11:12.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗娜？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lorna?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.37,0:11:17.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对不起 我在试图进入状态{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. I was trying to be in the moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.97,0:11:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}融入其中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Absorb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.31,0:11:28.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你觉得她以前见过阴茎吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think she ever saw a cock before this class?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.72,0:11:30.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果她看过 肯定是在波提切利的画里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If she did, it was in a Botticelli.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.12,0:11:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 我的天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.59,0:11:34.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果我听她再说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I hear her talk about…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.52,0:11:36.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果我听她再说 波提切利是多么地充满感情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}how emotional the Botticelllis are one more time…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.66,0:11:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我发誓 我会掐死她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear to God, I'm gonna choke the bitch to death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.47,0:11:46.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}下一次是下周二{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until Tuesday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.87,0:11:51.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去布拉格的行装收拾得怎么样了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you all packed for Prague?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.47,0:11:53.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 牛仔裤 平跟鞋 - 不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jeans. No heels. - Awesome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.07,0:11:55.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我在鹅卵石上做不来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't do it on the cobblestone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.32,0:11:56.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道你怎么办到的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how you do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.78,0:11:58.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我能教你 如果你带双高跟鞋的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can teach you if you bring heels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.39,0:12:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}艾希尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Axelle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.40,0:12:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拿起你们的铅笔 小伙子们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hands on your pencils, boys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.31,0:12:34.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 他会不会？- 抱歉 姑娘们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Would he ever? - Excuse me, girls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.85,0:12:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 抱歉 嗨 - 嗨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Excuse me. Hi. - Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.35,0:12:39.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我能看看吗？- 哦 画得不太好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- May I see? - Oh, they're just rough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.25,0:12:41.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给她看吧 别害羞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show her. Don't be shy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.39,0:12:46.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这张画的是你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the one of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.93,0:12:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 哦 太美了 - 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, wow, that's beautiful. - Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.50,0:12:51.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你打算多少钱卖？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much would you want for it?{\r}
