Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.36,0:19:24.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}打扰了 你们中有谁丢了这个吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me. Did one of you girls lose this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.03,0:19:26.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}噢 上帝！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.56,0:19:29.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你怎么知道这是我的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you know this was mine?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.53,0:19:31.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我看见一个人从你房间里跑出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw some guy run out of your room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.47,0:19:32.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他打算抢我的包{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He tried to take my bag.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.13,0:19:35.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我把他打倒了 这个是从他口袋里掉出来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fought him off and this felled out of his pocket.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.07,0:19:37.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我有点担心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a little worried he might…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.27,0:19:38.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他会回来找我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}come back looking for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.67,0:19:41.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你想过来和我们一起住吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you wanna come in here and hang out with us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.37,0:19:43.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 真的可以吗？- 是的 这里还有一个空位{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Really? - Yeah, we have an extra seat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.41,0:19:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 是的 来吧 - 真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, come in. - Totally.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.75,0:19:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.88,0:19:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.72,0:19:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们需要来点这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we all need a little of this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.55,0:19:54.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 太棒了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, awesome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.39,0:19:58.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 不 谢谢 我不喝酒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, thanks. I don't drink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.09,0:20:00.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.99,0:20:03.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我爸爸总是说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As my father always says:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.63,0:20:05.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「为你的健康干杯！」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Nazdrovia." To your health.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.28,0:20:22.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们是去到布拉格看球赛吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So are you going to Prague for the football match?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.22,0:20:24.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我有点想家了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I kind of wanna go home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.22,0:20:25.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是我说你们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I don't blame you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.45,0:20:28.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}曾经我也在过夜的火车上被劫过两次{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got robbed twice on the overnight train.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.89,0:20:30.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}欧洲没有什么真正安全的地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are so few safe places left in Europe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.39,0:20:32.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你要去哪里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So where are you going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.76,0:20:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只是一个小小的温泉度假旅行而已{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}On a little spa vacation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.86,0:20:36.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在哪？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.36,0:20:38.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}斯洛伐克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slovakia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.80,0:20:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等等 那里不是好像在打仗吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wasrt there, like, some war in Slovakia?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.14,0:20:45.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}斯洛伐克已经50年没有过战争了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There hasn't been war in Slovakia for 50 years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.57,0:20:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说的是波斯尼亚 亲爱的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Bosnia, darling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.01,0:20:49.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 哦 就你知道 - 的确是这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, like you knew. - I did so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.51,0:20:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那里的温泉怎么样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are the spas like there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.24,0:20:54.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那里有世界上最好的自然温泉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're the best natural hot springs in the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.08,0:20:56.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我每年都会去两次{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I go twice a year.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.17,0:20:59.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那里不会有意大利人找你麻烦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's great to get away from the Italian guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.35,0:21:00.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为那是不可能的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They get to be a bit much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.89,0:21:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哇噢 真的是温泉？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow, hot springs?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.09,0:21:07.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听上去很有保健作用 我想去那{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That sounds so therapeutic. I wanna go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.66,0:21:08.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那简单{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's very easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.57,0:21:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们只需在布拉格转车就行了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just have to switch trains in Prague.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.37,0:21:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那一定非常好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It could be nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.90,0:21:19.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这周末我已经受够了那些下流混蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know? I had enough gross guys for one weekend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.51,0:21:22.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 我们去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, we'll go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.95,0:21:28.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道住哪里好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know of a good place to stay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.92,0:21:32.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}穿鞋走会容易得多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smart move with the shoes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.41,0:21:34.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么？这很简单 我一定要试试{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? It's so easy. You have to try it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.22,0:22:05.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗨 我能为您效劳吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. Can I help you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.72,0:22:07.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的朋友们需要一个房间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need a room for my friends, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.07,0:22:08.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的 没问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.42,0:22:10.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请出示你们的护照{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your passports, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.33,0:22:16.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}美国人 非常好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}American. Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.63,0:22:19.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不错 每晚10欧元{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, cool. It's 10 Euros for night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.07,0:22:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 我来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I got this one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.84,0:22:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 这次轮到我了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. It's on me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.30,0:22:26.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 谢谢 - 给你钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you. - Money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.94,0:22:28.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.94,0:22:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是你们的钥匙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here are your keys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.88,0:22:35.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是今晚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this is a notice for the…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.68,0:22:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}丰收节晚会的公告{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}harvest fair tonight, girls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.68,0:22:40.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}肯定很好玩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will be sexy good times. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.72,0:22:43.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们管它叫多极克 我知道 每年都会有的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Dozinky. I know that. They have it every year.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.96,0:22:47.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 是的 - 很多音乐 舞蹈 奇装异服{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Lots of music, dancing, costumes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.66,0:22:49.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 天 我们能去吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my gosh! Could we go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.40,0:22:53.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 听上去像某种同性恋聚会 - 抱歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It sounds kind of gay. - Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.24,0:23:02.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 我们一定要去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, we are so going to the harvest festival.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.78,0:23:06.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 来吧 这边 - 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. This way. - Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.68,0:23:08.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不用客气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.52,0:23:14.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你觉得这里的房间会有壁画吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think they have any frescoes in the room?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.58,0:23:34.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「闲人免进」
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.18,0:23:39.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这房间看上去有一段历史了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow, this room feels so timeless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.31,0:23:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在开玩笑吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you kidding right now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.42,0:23:45.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.79,0:23:48.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}太性感了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sexy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.89,0:23:51.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来嘛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.96,0:26:03.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}太棒了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes! Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.79,0:26:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}太棒了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.23,0:26:07.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我就是这个意思 嗯？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I'm talking about, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.04,0:26:15.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「竞拍结束」
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.45,0:26:32.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}托德 怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Todd, what's up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.52,0:26:36.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没事 我们刚吃完早饭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, nothing. We're just finishing up breakfast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.06,0:26:40.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.00,0:26:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不敢相信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow, I didn't think…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.53,0:26:49.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天啊 你确定要这么做？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus. You sure?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.04,0:26:53.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 没问题 我现在就能走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah, okay. I can go right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.57,0:26:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会告诉她得去见一个客户{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell her I have to meet a client.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.88,0:26:58.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.95,0:27:00.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一会儿见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.81,0:27:31.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天 这个镇子太迷人了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gosh! This village is so enchanting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.01,0:27:34.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗娜 你现在是不是非常有写日记的冲动？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lorna, are you having a "journal-gasm" right now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.58,0:27:36.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}确实是 想写很多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, yes. Multiple ones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.82,0:27:39.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要写这个镇子有多美{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get to write about how beautiful this village is{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.05,0:27:42.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我还要写你是多么讨厌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I get to write about what a raving bitch you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.16,0:27:47.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她敢反驳了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She comes back swinging!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.33,0:27:50.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 就要这样 - 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well-played. - Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.30,0:27:54.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}美元！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dollar!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.00,0:27:56.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}美元！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dollar!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.50,0:27:58.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们有一美元吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you guys have a dollar?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.47,0:28:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我有 - 哦 不 不 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I got it. - Oh, no, no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.07,0:28:04.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 我有 让我来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. I got it. I got it. Let me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.62,0:28:10.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我有薄荷糖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have Smints.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.49,0:28:14.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来块薄荷糖怎么样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you like a Smint?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.80,0:28:28.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}婊子！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bitches!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.14,0:28:37.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}欢迎来到斯洛伐克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to Slovakia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.32,0:28:48.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们俩都是拐角的套房 可以看到整条河的景色{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You both have corner suites with views of the river.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.06,0:28:51.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是你们的呼叫器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here are your pagers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.32,0:28:54.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}非常好 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfect. Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.26,0:28:58.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你准备好了吗？- 是的 准备好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You ready to do this? - Yeah, I'm ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.77,0:29:01.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.37,0:29:03.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但你看上去垂头丧气的样子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you look like your dog just died.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.04,0:29:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只是时差没倒过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just jet-lagged, man.{\r}
